[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14642.55, "timestamp": "04:04:02", "text": "是故意对你不好，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14645.67, "timestamp": "04:04:05", "text": "例如，如果我对你说，“下巴”，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14647.229, "timestamp": "04:04:07", "text": "你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14649.75, "timestamp": "04:04:09", "text": "大多数我都不知道，我想不出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14652.63, "timestamp": "04:04:12", "text": "任何事物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14657.309, "timestamp": "04:04:17", "text": "你是最臭的YouTuber，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14659.51, "timestamp": "04:04:19", "text": "正确的？你知道，我不是故意要伤害你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14663.11, "timestamp": "04:04:23", "text": "你，因为我，我们此刻在一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14664.55, "timestamp": "04:04:24", "text": "正确的？我当时正试图给出一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14667.51, "timestamp": "04:04:27", "text": "例子。是的。所以，一切都顺其自然了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14670.78, "timestamp": "04:04:30", "text": "是的。但假设这是事先写好的剧本，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14672.07, "timestamp": "04:04:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14673.91, "timestamp": "04:04:33", "text": "我把它写在剧本里了。我要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14675.59, "timestamp": "04:04:35", "text": "给我打电话。我打算给你打电话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14677.83, "timestamp": "04:04:37", "text": "这里臭死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14681.349, "timestamp": "04:04:41", "text": "然后，就感觉不像是在里面了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14687.229, "timestamp": "04:04:47", "text": "比如有人对你很刻薄"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14690.15, "timestamp": "04:04:50", "text": "出于剧本安排的原因，感觉并不像这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14691.75, "timestamp": "04:04:51", "text": "就是这样。我不知道自己在说什么，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14693.269, "timestamp": "04:04:53", "text": "但是，你明白我的意思吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14694.79, "timestamp": "04:04:54", "text": "试图沟通？是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14697.349, "timestamp": "04:04:57", "text": "是的。是的。是的，我明白了。是的。"}]